# LED's ability makes mana, so it can be activated in the middle of paying for a spell (CR 605.3a). The Bolt has left the
# hand by then, so the discard cost takes the other five cards; the three red mana pays the Bolt, which resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Lion's Eye Diamond
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Lion's Eye Diamond.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Lion's Eye Diamond.Activate(Color: Red)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
